    "description": "The Corporate Finance Public Offering API enables businesses to initiate and manage public offering processes for corporate finance. This API facilitates the creation of public offerings, allowing organizations to raise capital through the public markets. Common consumers include investment firms, corporate finance departments, and financial advisors, who leverage this functionality to streamline their funding strategies. The endpoint supports the transmission of offering details, participant information, and regulatory compliance data, ensuring a seamless process for stakeholders involved in public offerings.",
